    "sourceNumber": "一、7",
    "parentNumber": 7,
    "subnumber": null,
    "blocks": [
      {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "在直角三角形 $ABC$ 中，$\\angle ABC$ 為直角，且 $\\overline{AB}=10$、$\\overline{BC}=24$，若 $\\overline{BD}$ 為斜邊上的高，則 $\\overline{BD}=$ ＿＿。"
      }
    ],
    "sourceSha256": "7c235ce425ee5e2978fd777495b922dae7345412c23e0d70ca4ee14073219459",
    "verified": true,
    "sourcePrintedYear": 108,
